<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Rampsmith deleted the data for Example Outfitters" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="rs-page" style="background-color:#f3f4f6;color:#111827;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;padding:24px 12px"><!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" align="center" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto"><div class="rs-card" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;padding:32px 24px"><p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em">Rampsmith</p>
<h1 class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">Data deleted</h1>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">Rampsmith deleted the data it held for <bdi>Example Outfitters</bdi> on <bdi>October 19, 2026</bdi>: store content, theme snapshots, scan evidence, findings, fixes and the remediation log.</p>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">Rampsmith keeps billing records only for as long as tax law requires.</p>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">This is the last email Rampsmith sends about <bdi>Example Outfitters</bdi>.</p>
</div>
<div style="padding:24px 8px 0"><p class="rs-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#4b5563">You received this email because this address is the contact for <bdi>Example Outfitters</bdi> in Rampsmith.</p>
<p class="rs-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#4b5563">Questions? Write to <a class="rs-link" href="mailto:support@rampsmith.example" style="color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:underline"><bdi>support@rampsmith.example</bdi></a>.</p>
<p class="rs-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#4b5563">Rampsmith<br>100 Example Street<br>Springfield, EX 00000<br>United States (test fixture)</p>
</div>
</div>
